5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to know which past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how long the construction takes and how the rooms are used later.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The schedules keep slipping. I want to see why the timelines are always wrong.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,The costs on paper never match reality. I need to see the actual spending data.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The same few staff are doing all the work. I want to check the staffing levels.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, do you have specific data on room usage?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Not yet, but I suspect the booking data will show the truth.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the delivery schedules to see where the delays come from.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I will check the tender records to see if prices are rising unexpectedly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the staffing posts to see who is actually working.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will investigate the post-occupancy reviews to see what users think.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the booking data to see which rooms are actually used.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the weather days in the site diaries.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the renewal reserve for equipment to see if we are saving money.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will also look at the bench technicians' routines to see their workload.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's see what the data says before we decide.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Data is better than guesswork.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Yes, let's be logical about this.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I hope the numbers make sense this time.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,We need to be fair to the staff too.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
