35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The post-occupancy reviews are telling. Projects with open booking were rated highest.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"That matches my findings. General rooms are always full, specialist ones are empty.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The delivery schedules show comfort projects slip, but inspection fixes are on time.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Tender records show mechanical costs rising, but surfacing costs are stable.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Staffing is tight. Technicians are doing manual work that machines should do.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, so if we pick a comfort project, it will be late?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"And if we pick a specialist room, it will sit empty.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,Likely. The data is clear on that point.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,The equipment renewal reserve is empty. We are not saving for replacements.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,The technicians are overworked. We need to reduce their manual burden.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The survey findings in older blocks are bad. Hazardous materials cause delays.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The timetable records show we pay for off-site space when rooms are closed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,Weather days cost us six weeks on the last two jobs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,So mechanical upgrades are getting more expensive and risky.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we upgrade ventilation, the technicians will have less manual work.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,We need a project that is used by many and doesn't delay.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,And one that doesn't cost us extra for off-site space.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,And one that isn't exposed to weather.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,And one that doesn't have rising mechanical costs.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,And one that helps the staff.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
